id: pm-context-1fqt
title: Restore the 2026.8.9 release on main to match npm
description: "npm serves pm-context@2026.8.9 but git main is still at 2026.8.7 with no v2026.08.09 tag. Bring main to 2026.8.9: bump package.json/package-lock.json/manifest.json/index.ts, rebuild committed dist/, and regenerate CHANGELOG.md so the 2026.8.9 section exists and both changelog checks pass. Do not create or push the git tag; the orchestrator tags after the PR merges."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[3]: reconciliation,release,version-drift
created_at: "2026-08-09T12:47:48.010Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-09T13:15:03.867Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-09T13:15:03.834Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-09T13:15:03.834Z"
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: "package.json, package-lock.json, manifest.json and index.ts report version 2026.8.9; committed dist/ matches a clean rebuild; CHANGELOG.md contains a 2026.8.9 section and both changelog:check and changelog:full:check pass; release:check (including the 100/100/100 coverage gate) passes; no git tag is created."
risk: high
resolution: Brought main's version metadata to 2026.8.9 and regenerated the changelog so the 2026.8.9 section exists and matches npm's released tarball contents.
expected_result: package.json/lock/manifest/index.ts and committed dist/ report 2026.8.9; CHANGELOG.md has a 2026.8.9 section; both changelog checks pass; no tag created.
actual_result: "All version sources at 2026.8.9; dist/index.js matches a clean rebuild; changelog:check and changelog:full:check exit 0; release:check exit 0; no tag created or pushed."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-09T13:14:31.767Z",pi-agent,"Reconciled git main to npm's 2026.8.9: set version 2026.8.9 in package.json, package-lock.json, manifest.json, and index.ts (mirroring the CI 'Update release version' step exactly, so dist/ is byte-identical to a release build); rm -rf dist && npm run build rebuilt committed dist/index.js (only the embedded version string changed). Regenerated CHANGELOG.md (replace/full mode) so the 2026.8.9 section exists."
  "2026-08-09T13:14:32.224Z",pi-agent,"Cleared a stale release:Unreleased pin on pm-context-5njx: that field kept the chore out of the versioned section in prepend (changelog:check) mode while full (changelog:full:check) mode still placed it in 2026.8.9, so the two PR-time checks disagreed once the pending version became 2026.8.9. npm 2026.8.9 already ships 5njx under 2026.8.9, and every other released item carries no release field, so clearing the pin matches npm and the repo convention. No git tag created or pushed; tagging is deferred to the orchestrator after the PR merges."
files[7]{path,scope,note}:
  .agents/pm/chores/pm-context-5njx.toon,project,"stale release:Unreleased pin cleared"
  CHANGELOG.md,project,2026.8.9 section regenerated
  dist/index.js,project,rebuilt at 2026.8.9
  index.ts,project,embedded version 2026.8.9
  manifest.json,project,version 2026.8.9
  package-lock.json,project,version 2026.8.9
  package.json,project,version 2026.8.9
tests[2]{command,scope,note}:
  "npm run changelog:check",project,prepend changelog check green
  "npm run changelog:full:check",project,full changelog check green
close_reason: "git main reconciled to 2026.8.9 to match npm: version bumped in package.json/package-lock.json/manifest.json/index.ts, dist/index.js rebuilt, CHANGELOG.md regenerated with a 2026.8.9 section, and the stale release:Unreleased pin on pm-context-5njx cleared. Both changelog checks and the full release gate (incl. 100/100/100 coverage) pass. No git tag created (deferred to orchestrator)."
body: ""
